      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process, start with Insurance \"emergency\" and then analyze the insurance agreement."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If there is coverage, offer immediate help."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If there is no coverage, send out an offer for emergency help."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If the offer is rejected, ask for a rejection notification."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If it is accepted, proceed with internal accounting."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "Repeat the same steps if necessary."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "The process concludes once all steps have been completed."
